Refuse

The accumulation of waste and litter (such as programmes and food and drink packaging) should be avoided. All parts of the premises should therefore be inspected before, during (as far as is practicable) and after each event or period open to the public. Any accumulation of waste or litter should be removed without delay or kept in a fire-resisting container or room, pending removal.

Sufficient waste and litter bins should be provided and arrangements made for their frequent emptying, especially during an event or function of extended duration.
